Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:52:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/40] ffi-go audit: C/Go tests for the embedding ABI (fail on
 baseline)

C (ffi/audit): contract edge cases (init race, calls before init, NULL
arguments, double unload, use after unload, embedded NUL, invalid UTF-8,
1000/20000 short-lived threads, host side effects of figram_init), malloc
failure injection in dup() (--wrap=malloc), concurrent stress on one handle
with load/unload of other handles (plain/ASan+UBSan/TSan builds), adapted
build for a gcc/libstdc++ Lean toolchain, regress.sh.

Go (audit_test.go): Close vs Request storm, missing/non-string op, NUL in
Load/Request, large requests, hello reply, scaling, soak, SIGPROF storm,
concurrent init, SIGPIPE, OS thread count.

(cherry picked from commit 96ca9aa08b21a534c701632401201a8c52e99ab7)

